# Actually maybe simpler: output window is the UNIQUE window that contains a solid-color blob (all same color, connected) whose bbox is smaller than window, with exactly one foreign pixel touching it. Size selection: largest? Check which window size per demo: does another comp satisfy but smaller?
def qual(g, w):
